1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:02,480
College English Test, Band 4.
大学英语四级考试。

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,960
Part 2, Listening Comprehension.
第二部分，听力理解。

3
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:07,280
Section A, Directions.
A 节，答题说明。

4
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:10,260
In this section, you'll hear three news reports.
本节你将听到三篇新闻报道。

5
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:14,400
At the end of each news report, you'll hear two or three questions.
每篇报道结束后，你会听到两到三个问题。

6
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:18,300
Both the news report and the questions will be spoken only once.
新闻报道和问题都只读一遍。

7
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:26,160
After you hear a question, you must choose the best answer from the four choices marked A, B, C and D.
听完问题后，你必须从 A、B、C、D 四个选项中选出最佳答案。

8
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:30,900
Then mark the corresponding letter on answer sheet one with a single line through the center.
然后在答题卡一上，用一条横线穿过字母中心来标记对应选项。

9
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,380
News Report 1
新闻报道一

10
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:40,760
A woman was charged with allegedly violating a Rhode Island city law against feeding wild animals.
一名女子被控涉嫌违反罗德岛州某市禁止投喂野生动物的法律。
